            "syntax": "try (BufferedReader reader = new BufferedReader(new FileReader(\"data.txt\"))) {\n    String line;\n    while ((line = reader.readLine()) != null) {\n        System.out.println(line);\n    }\n} catch (IOException e) {\n    e.printStackTrace();\n}\n",
